# PEARL: One day, cloudflare started giving me an "Asset too large" error.
# Specifically, the error was as follows:
#    ✘ [ERROR] Asset too large.
#    Cloudflare Workers supports assets with sizes of up to 25 MiB. 
#    We found a file /opt/buildhome/repo/.git/objects/pack/pack-<...>.pack with
#    a size of 59.3 MiB.
#    Ensure all assets in your assets directory "/opt/buildhome/repo" conform
#    with the Workers maximum size requirement.
# A web search for this problem yielded this discussion:
# https://github.com/cloudflare/workerd/issues/4336
# which suggests creating this file to solve the problem.

.git
.git/
**/.git
**/.git/
**/.git/**

node_modules
node_modules/
**/node_modules/**

.wrangler
.wrangler/
**/.wrangler/**

*.pack
*.idx
*.rev
*.bitmap
